  "notes": ["Render pipeline: the 480x270 game renders into a SubViewport (res://MainScene.tscn), integer-scaled to the window (stretch mode canvas_items, scale_mode integer; default window 1440x810: res://project.godot).", "The CRT ColorRect sits on CanvasLayer 4 over the whole window and reads the screen texture, so the CRT runs at window resolution, not 480x270. SCREEN_PIXEL_SIZE (chromatic offsets, 3-px RGB grid) is therefore in window pixels.", "WorldEnvironment glow (2D HDR glow, background_mode canvas) applies to canvas layers up to 10. Glow intensity is 1.8 with CRT on and 0.9 with CRT off (res://Scripts/Autoloads/OptionData.gd:86-92).", "Glitch overlay is hidden except during the godvirus ending, where shake_power tweens 0 -> 0.8 over 10 s (res://Scripts/Ending.gd:41-52).", "BloomShader.gdshader and GlitchShader.gdshader (texture version) ship but are not referenced by any scene."],
